<title>GREECE: TABLE-Greek/Bund gap widens to 411 bps, 322 vs BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Greek/Bund gap widens to 411 bps, 322 vs BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds widened to 411 basis points on Tuesday from 404 basis points on Monday as Greek bonds continued to be battered by the high cost of carry.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also increased to 322 basis points from Monday's 310 basis points.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.65%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.0%    04JUL07    5.54%	411	404 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.5%    25APR07    5.39%	426	417 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.43%	322	310 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.26%	339	333 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.18%	348	374 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.13%	252	246 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.35%	330	326 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 1028 GMT.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
